  "definition": "Label Information",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-05-23",
  "historyNote": "#2075, eff 8-1-82; ss by #2825, eff 8-20-84; EXPIRED 8-20-92 New. #5488, eff 10-15-92, EXPIRED: 10-15-98 New. #7054, eff 7-20-99, EXPIRED: 7-20-07 New. #12487, INTERIM, eff 3-1-18, EXPIRED: 8-28-18 New. #12788, eff 5-23-19",
